          },
          {
            "index": 3005,
            "source_segment_index": 3005,
            "start_ms": 5714620,
            "end_ms": 5716980,
            "text": "来给各位弹幕老师们做本酒席的复盘"
          },
          {
            "index": 3006,
            "source_segment_index": 3006,
            "start_ms": 5716980,
            "end_ms": 5720140,
            "text": "本局版行为假面舞会寻人阵营预言家"
          },
          {
            "index": 3007,
            "source_segment_index": 3007,
            "start_ms": 5720140,
            "end_ms": 5720900,
            "text": "5号女巫"
          },
          {
            "index": 3008,
            "source_segment_index": 3008,
            "start_ms": 5720900,
            "end_ms": 5721800,
            "text": "12号舞者"
          },
          {
            "index": 3009,
            "source_segment_index": 3009,
            "start_ms": 5721800,
            "end_ms": 5722660,
            "text": "一号白神"
          },
          {
            "index": 3010,
            "source_segment_index": 3010,
            "start_ms": 5722660,
            "end_ms": 5728340,
            "text": "10号狼人阵营2号三号九号假面6号平民阵营"
          },
          {
            "index": 3011,
            "source_segment_index": 3011,
            "start_ms": 5728340,
            "end_ms": 5729520,
            "text": "4号七号"
          },
          {
            "index": 3012,
            "source_segment_index": 3012,
            "start_ms": 5729520,
            "end_ms": 5733940,
            "text": "8号11号首页狼人击杀10号白神女巫要救起"
          },
          {
            "index": 3013,
            "source_segment_index": 3013,
            "start_ms": 5733940,
            "end_ms": 5734700,
            "text": "形成平安夜"
          },
          {
            "index": 3014,
            "source_segment_index": 3014,
            "start_ms": 5734700,
            "end_ms": 5736020,
            "text": "预言家验证了一号玩家"
          },
          {
            "index": 3015,
            "source_segment_index": 3015,
            "start_ms": 5736020,
            "end_ms": 5737379,
            "text": "五者为好人身份"
          },
          {
            "index": 3016,
            "source_segment_index": 3016,
            "start_ms": 5737379,
            "end_ms": 5738939,
            "text": "在警上竞选环节"
          },
          {
            "index": 3017,
            "source_segment_index": 3017,
            "start_ms": 5738939,
            "end_ms": 5740790,
            "text": "5号预言家获得警徽"
          },
          {
            "index": 3018,
            "source_segment_index": 3018,
            "start_ms": 5740790,
            "end_ms": 5741870,
            "text": "第一天的白天"
          },
          {
            "index": 3019,
            "source_segment_index": 3019,
            "start_ms": 5741870,
            "end_ms": 5744310,
            "text": "5号预言家被抗推出局"
          },
          {
            "index": 3020,
            "source_segment_index": 3020,
            "start_ms": 5744310,
            "end_ms": 5747040,
            "text": "警徽移交至一号舞者"
          },
          {
            "index": 3021,
            "source_segment_index": 3021,
            "start_ms": 5747400,
            "end_ms": 5751040,
            "text": "入夜舞者的舞池是2号狼人"
          },
          {
            "index": 3022,
            "source_segment_index": 3022,
            "start_ms": 5751040,
            "end_ms": 5754100,
            "text": "3号狼人以及6号假面假面"
          },
          {
            "index": 3023,
            "source_segment_index": 3023,
            "start_ms": 5754100,
            "end_ms": 5755980,
            "text": "验证12号女巫不在舞池内"
          },
          {
            "index": 3024,
            "source_segment_index": 3024,
            "start_ms": 5755980,
            "end_ms": 5758040,
            "text": "给予了8号平民一张面具"
          },
          {
            "index": 3025,
            "source_segment_index": 3025,
            "start_ms": 5758040,
            "end_ms": 5759940,
            "text": "此时五池内无事发生"
          },
          {
            "index": 3026,
            "source_segment_index": 3026,
            "start_ms": 5759940,
            "end_ms": 5761560,
            "text": "狼人击杀12号女巫"
          },
          {
            "index": 3027,
            "source_segment_index": 3027,
            "start_ms": 5761560,
            "end_ms": 5763140,
            "text": "女巫毒杀2号狼人"
          },
          {
            "index": 3028,
            "source_segment_index": 3028,
            "start_ms": 5763140,
            "end_ms": 5764570,
            "text": "2号12号双死"
          },
          {
            "index": 3029,
            "source_segment_index": 3029,
            "start_ms": 5764570,
            "end_ms": 5765550,
            "text": "第二天的白天"
          },
          {
            "index": 3030,
            "source_segment_index": 3030,
            "start_ms": 5765550,
            "end_ms": 5766770,
            "text": "3号狼人选择自爆"
          },
          {
            "index": 3031,
            "source_segment_index": 3031,
            "start_ms": 5766770,
            "end_ms": 5769370,
            "text": "入夜舞者的舞池是8号平民"
          },
          {
            "index": 3032,
            "source_segment_index": 3032,
            "start_ms": 5769370,
            "end_ms": 5770770,
            "text": "9号狼人"
          },
          {
            "index": 3033,
            "source_segment_index": 3033,
            "start_ms": 5770770,
            "end_ms": 5774100,
            "text": "10号白神假面验证了7号玩家"
          },
          {
            "index": 3034,
            "source_segment_index": 3034,
            "start_ms": 5774100,
            "end_ms": 5775140,
            "text": "平民不在五之内"
          },
          {
            "index": 3035,
            "source_segment_index": 3035,
            "start_ms": 5775140,
            "end_ms": 5777040,
            "text": "给予了4号平民一张面具"
          },
          {
            "index": 3036,
            "source_segment_index": 3036,
            "start_ms": 5777040,
            "end_ms": 5779970,
            "text": "此时五室内9号狼人被五出局"
          },
          {
            "index": 3037,
            "source_segment_index": 3037,
            "start_ms": 5779970,
            "end_ms": 5780930,
            "text": "狼人击杀"
          },
          {
            "index": 3038,
            "source_segment_index": 3038,
            "start_ms": 5780930,
            "end_ms": 5782190,
            "text": "11号平民"
          },
          {
            "index": 3039,
            "source_segment_index": 3039,
            "start_ms": 5782190,
            "end_ms": 5783870,
            "text": "9号11号双死"
          },
          {
            "index": 3040,
            "source_segment_index": 3040,
            "start_ms": 5783870,
            "end_ms": 5786910,
            "text": "第三天白天假面选择交牌游戏结束"
          },
          {
            "index": 3041,
            "source_segment_index": 3041,
            "start_ms": 5786910,
            "end_ms": 5788040,
            "text": "好人阵营获胜"
          },
          {
            "index": 3042,
            "source_segment_index": 3042,
            "start_ms": 5788040,
            "end_ms": 5790800,
            "text": "以上是我们今天第二局假面舞会的全部内容"
          },
          {
            "index": 3043,
            "source_segment_index": 3043,
            "start_ms": 5790800,
            "end_ms": 5792220,
            "text": "感谢各位家人的陪伴"
          },
          {
            "index": 3044,
            "source_segment_index": 3044,
            "start_ms": 5792220,
            "end_ms": 5795080,
            "text": "这里是京城大师赛第21赛季"
          },
          {
            "index": 3045,
            "source_segment_index": 3045,
            "start_ms": 5795080,
            "end_ms": 5796770,
            "text": "葵曲奇谭的直播现场"
          },
          {
            "index": 3046,
            "source_segment_index": 3046,
            "start_ms": 5796770,
            "end_ms": 5799490,
            "text": "然后我们本赛季也再一次感谢天天狼人app"
          },
          {
            "index": 3047,
            "source_segment_index": 3047,
            "start_ms": 5799490,
            "end_ms": 5801400,
            "text": "对我们节目的冠名赞助支持"
          },
          {
            "index": 3048,
            "source_segment_index": 3048,
            "start_ms": 5801400,
            "end_ms": 5802400,
            "text": "希望各位家人们"
          },
          {
            "index": 3049,
            "source_segment_index": 3049,
            "start_ms": 5802400,
            "end_ms": 5804060,
            "text": "随时可以来到我们各大应用平台"
          },
          {
            "index": 3050,
            "source_segment_index": 3050,
            "start_ms": 5804060,
            "end_ms": 5806200,
            "text": "搜索并下载天天狼人app"
          },
          {
            "index": 3051,
            "source_segment_index": 3051,
            "start_ms": 5806200,
            "end_ms": 5808070,
            "text": "就可以跟我们一起来玩网杀游戏了"
          },
          {
            "index": 3052,
            "source_segment_index": 3052,
            "start_ms": 5808070,
            "end_ms": 5811230,
            "text": "同样也再一次感谢柠檬共和国揽赤霞"
          },
          {
            "index": 3053,
            "source_segment_index": 3053,
            "start_ms": 5811230,
            "end_ms": 5814059,
            "text": "以及哈尼牧场对我们节目的特约赞助支持"
          },
          {
            "index": 3054,
            "source_segment_index": 3054,
            "start_ms": 5814059,
            "end_ms": 5815739,
            "text": "家人们也可以随时来到我们这儿"
          },
          {
            "index": 3055,
            "source_segment_index": 3055,
            "start_ms": 5815739,
            "end_ms": 5818239,
            "text": "代师个人主义的橱窗内进行下单补货"
          },
          {
            "index": 3056,
            "source_segment_index": 3056,
            "start_ms": 5818239,
            "end_ms": 5820939,
            "text": "同样的也再次感谢阿喵呃"
          },
          {
            "index": 3057,
            "source_segment_index": 3057,
            "start_ms": 5820939,
            "end_ms": 5823370,
            "text": "希总和Mark老师给我投食"
          },
          {
            "index": 3058,
            "source_segment_index": 3058,
            "start_ms": 5823370,
            "end_ms": 5824890,
            "text": "明天下午的16点整"
          },
          {
            "index": 3059,
            "source_segment_index": 3059,
            "start_ms": 5824890,
            "end_ms": 5826350,
            "text": "在我们今日神选直播间"
          },
          {
            "index": 3060,
            "source_segment_index": 3060,
            "start_ms": 5826350,
            "end_ms": 5829320,
            "text": "会为各位带来一场水晶的专场带货"
          },
          {
            "index": 3061,
            "source_segment_index": 3061,
            "start_ms": 5829320,
            "end_ms": 5831160,
            "text": "希望各位家人们如果想要的话"
          },
          {
            "index": 3062,
            "source_segment_index": 3062,
            "start_ms": 5831160,
            "end_ms": 5833620,
            "text": "可以来到我明天下午的京师甄选直播间"
          },
          {
